STRICT EDITING RULES — follow exactly:
1. DO NOT add, generate, or insert any food, drinks, dishes, ingredients, or physical objects into the scene — none whatsoever
2. DO NOT replace or reimagine the background — the pub interior must remain exactly as photographed
3. ONLY apply: warm colour grading, subtle lighting enhancement, and the text overlay described above
4. Text style: gold and cream tones, tasteful serif typography, feels like it was always part of the scene
5. Square 1:1 composition. No logos. No watermarks.
6. Final result = the same real pub interior, colour-graded and branded with text — nothing else added`;

